HISTORICAL TIMELINE
================================================================================

THE GRIP (Circa -1000 years before mod start)
- Catastrophic dimensional breach tears open massive rifts
- Civilized world collapses; billions die
- Civilization reduced to scattered survivors
- The fabric between dimensions becomes scarred/unstable
- Planar entities breach into material plane (never fully sealed)
- Multiple star systems may have been lost in cosmic fallout
- Technology of pre-Grip civilization mostly lost (scattered salvage remains)

FIRST ERA: POST-GRIP RECOVERY (0-131 AG)
Duration: ~131 years of rebuilding

Salvage Society Era
- Survivors emerge from shelters/bunkers; primitive but tech-aware
- Economy based on scavenging pre-Grip technology
- Small settlements grow into cities
- Knowledge of old world slowly recovers from archives/artifacts

Key Settlements Founded:
- Thryst: Major trading hub (Campaign 1-2 hub city)
- Varrack: Survivor settlement (built in harsh environment)
- Maes: Neighboring settlement to Thryst region
