Key Conflicts & Events:
- Red Portal Mystery: Dimensional breach investigation (ongoing mystery)
- Statue Mystery: Investigation of mysterious statue (ongoing throughout era)
- Eta Indri Invasion: External military threat (repelled/resolved)
